WEBVTT

00:31.823 --> 00:33.950
You look perfect, Hiro.

00:34.701 --> 00:38.163
Shall we get out once the actress
ahead of us is past the main photo line?

00:43.710 --> 00:44.544
Who is that?

00:45.045 --> 00:46.671
Don't you know her?

00:46.755 --> 00:47.922
That's Do Ra-mi.

00:48.006 --> 00:50.675
The one who's blowing up globally.
Do Ra-mi!

00:51.176 --> 00:53.094
No, I don't know her.

00:53.803 --> 00:55.263
You really don't?

00:55.764 --> 00:58.016
You haven't seen the Do Ra-mi movie?

00:58.683 --> 00:59.809
He has.

00:59.893 --> 01:03.980
It was in your Netflix viewing history,
both this month and last.

01:04.564 --> 01:06.691
Right, that killer zombie?

01:06.775 --> 01:08.318
What was the actress's name again?

01:08.401 --> 01:09.861
Cha Mu-hee.

01:10.987 --> 01:14.783
Her name was in your search history,
yet you don't remember?

01:15.909 --> 01:18.536
Why do you even have my tablet?

01:18.620 --> 01:20.830
You said to always stand by
with it in hand.

01:20.914 --> 01:22.624
Don't snoop without permission.

01:22.707 --> 01:24.084
-Mirror.
-Here.

01:29.964 --> 01:30.799
Okay.

01:35.929 --> 01:37.180
What's up with her?

01:39.682 --> 01:41.976
Why's she standing there like a zombie?

01:42.060 --> 01:43.561
You're right, she is.

01:43.645 --> 01:46.481
She's been standing there long enough.
What is she doing?

01:46.564 --> 01:48.483
She should go so you can have your moment.

01:48.566 --> 01:50.193
Something seems off with her.

01:50.693 --> 01:52.987
She doesn't look well.

01:53.071 --> 01:56.157
If she faints, this red-carpet event
will come to a screeching halt.

01:56.950 --> 01:57.784
What?

01:57.867 --> 01:59.619
But I waited three months.

01:59.702 --> 02:02.956
I waited three months
for this custom-made suit from Italy.

02:03.623 --> 02:06.459
I can't let that happen.

02:08.419 --> 02:09.879
-Hiro!
-Hiro!

02:10.421 --> 02:12.715
No way. Is he going to walk past her?

02:13.216 --> 02:15.802
He wouldn't do something so insane,

02:15.885 --> 02:18.429
even if he wants to show off
that custom-made suit.

02:18.513 --> 02:22.934
Hiro is attending
the Tokyo International Film Festival

02:23.017 --> 02:24.477
for the second year in a row.

02:24.561 --> 02:29.399
This year, his performance as Hideo
in Can I Love You? earned him acclaim.

02:34.404 --> 02:35.530
Wake up.

02:37.574 --> 02:38.449
I'll help you.

02:44.080 --> 02:45.290
Let's walk together.

02:58.178 --> 03:03.016
These two have been in touch to say
they just can't make the schedule work.

03:03.516 --> 03:06.603
These three are definitely interested,

03:06.686 --> 03:10.190
but they said they couldn't decide yet
and asked for more time.

03:10.273 --> 03:13.234
As for these two,
they're very keen to join the show,

03:13.318 --> 03:15.486
but I don't think Hiro will approve.

03:15.570 --> 03:18.907
Man, casting this show is such a pain.

03:19.741 --> 03:24.287
We need to confirm
the female cast member within the week.

03:25.371 --> 03:26.915
How about Cha Mu-hee?

03:27.498 --> 03:28.541
Cha Mu-hee?

03:29.125 --> 03:30.126
You mean Do Ra-mi?

03:30.627 --> 03:32.253
Do Ra-mi's a zombie.

03:33.046 --> 03:36.466
Our show's called Romantic Trip.
Would a zombie really be a good fit?

03:36.549 --> 03:38.468
I think they might make a good match.

03:39.010 --> 03:40.929
This was just taken at the film festival.

03:41.429 --> 03:43.514
Take a look. People are going wild.

03:47.435 --> 03:49.229
Hasn't the Do Ra-mi craze died down?

03:49.312 --> 03:53.524
I heard the drama she was set to star in
at her peak got canceled.

04:10.792 --> 04:12.168
I don't hate this.

04:13.503 --> 04:14.420
I love it!

04:14.504 --> 04:15.338
Seriously?

04:15.922 --> 04:18.466
-Check her availability with her agency.
-Yes, sir.

04:18.549 --> 04:19.467
On it.

04:20.426 --> 04:23.054
Japan's ultimate romantic prince

04:23.554 --> 04:26.349
meets Korea's horror queen.

04:26.432 --> 04:27.850
Nice to meet you.

04:31.771 --> 04:32.730
Howdy.

04:35.316 --> 04:37.819
Their personas are polar opposites.

04:37.902 --> 04:40.571
They are, which is why
communication would be key.

04:40.655 --> 04:43.032
That's the theme of our show.

04:43.116 --> 04:45.827
Two people
with different cultures and languages

04:45.910 --> 04:49.289
rubbing off on each other while traveling.

04:50.248 --> 04:52.292
A meeting of black and pink.

04:52.875 --> 04:53.751
Blackpink?

04:54.836 --> 04:56.671
Our show should make it big like them!

04:57.755 --> 04:58.715
Blackpink!

05:21.696 --> 05:26.367
CAN THIS LOVE BE TRANSLATED?

05:33.916 --> 05:36.502
The doctor will be arriving shortly.

05:36.586 --> 05:38.212
Great, thank you.

05:42.383 --> 05:46.721
You won't get sleeping pills or sedatives
this late at night without a prescription.

05:47.472 --> 05:50.850
Fortunately, a psychiatrist I know
is willing to see you,

05:50.933 --> 05:52.018
so see him first.

05:53.061 --> 05:55.563
I just need some medication.

05:56.564 --> 05:59.067
There's an important event
I need to attend.

05:59.150 --> 06:00.068
Tell the doctor.

06:01.652 --> 06:04.697
By the way,
how did you know I was at that hotel?

06:05.823 --> 06:07.950
I'm staying at that hotel too.

06:08.618 --> 06:12.497
Yong-u, my manager,
said he saw you in the lobby earlier.

06:13.247 --> 06:14.248
I see.

06:17.043 --> 06:19.003
Any symptoms other than anxiety?

06:20.838 --> 06:22.382
What, do you think I'm faking it?

06:22.882 --> 06:27.053
I'm dizzy, shaking, nauseous, feverish,
and feel like I'm about to faint.

06:29.722 --> 06:30.848
Let's check for a fever.

06:32.392 --> 06:33.434
What are you doing?

06:35.269 --> 06:37.063
Ms. Cha Mu-hee, this is a hospital.

06:37.688 --> 06:42.110
If I told the doctor what you just said,
you'd be hospitalized, event or not.

06:42.652 --> 06:44.612
-Don't mess around.
-Earlier, I really…

06:46.864 --> 06:48.616
I really did feel that way earlier.

06:48.699 --> 06:51.369
Why else would I ask for help
from a guy who rejected…

06:59.419 --> 07:01.295
Ho-jin, sorry to keep you waiting.

07:01.379 --> 07:02.338
Not at all.

07:03.589 --> 07:04.924
Come in. This way.

07:07.760 --> 07:08.636
Let's go in.

07:08.719 --> 07:09.554
Here.

07:15.184 --> 07:18.396
Just tell him I came in for a prescription

07:18.896 --> 07:22.275
because my heart was racing
and I felt really anxious.

07:35.204 --> 07:39.125
He's asking you to describe in detail
the symptoms of your anxiety.

07:39.834 --> 07:41.294
Does he have to know that?

07:42.086 --> 07:42.920
He is a doctor.

07:45.381 --> 07:49.427
I just want him to write a prescription
without asking for details.

07:50.094 --> 07:52.138
You're not buying painkillers
at a drugstore.

07:52.221 --> 07:54.599
I could buy pills at a drugstore myself.

07:54.682 --> 07:55.892
Exactly.

07:57.393 --> 07:59.437
You came here because you're struggling.

07:59.520 --> 08:01.981
Just tell him
what you're struggling with and how.

08:08.863 --> 08:11.157
He's a doctor,
so he'll keep this confidential, right?

08:14.702 --> 08:16.537
Since you're interpreting for me,

08:17.038 --> 08:19.290
you'd hear exactly
what's going on with me.

08:19.373 --> 08:21.834
I'd need to hear to interpret, yes.

08:26.339 --> 08:28.216
Otherwise, you should fly back to Korea.

08:28.799 --> 08:30.218
You could catch a red-eye.

08:30.301 --> 08:33.179
No! I told you, I have a big event.

08:33.262 --> 08:36.349
World-class directors and actors
are waiting for me.

08:36.432 --> 08:37.850
So is that doctor.

08:44.065 --> 08:45.441
Then I'll just say it.

08:48.152 --> 08:50.071
The reason I'm anxious is…

08:52.615 --> 08:54.450
To be honest, I recently started

08:55.785 --> 08:56.953
seeing Do Ra-mi.

09:03.209 --> 09:05.419
She just appears out of the blue.

09:10.091 --> 09:11.384
And she laughs…

09:14.387 --> 09:15.888
as if she's mocking me.

09:27.608 --> 09:31.445
At first, I thought I was seeing things
due to the fatigue.

09:33.364 --> 09:34.615
But that wasn't it.

09:36.242 --> 09:38.119
Because I kept seeing her.

09:40.204 --> 09:43.082
I hear Director Peter Jason
will be at the festival after-party.

09:43.165 --> 09:44.083
Awesome, right?

09:44.959 --> 09:47.003
And there'll be tons of famous actors.

09:47.503 --> 09:49.338
Would it be rude to ask for a selfie?

09:49.422 --> 09:52.008
I know she's not real,
so I'd like to shake her off,

09:53.718 --> 09:56.095
but I can't because I see her so clearly.

09:57.847 --> 10:00.975
I'm constantly on edge,
scared she'll suddenly appear.

10:02.560 --> 10:03.936
And today,

10:05.438 --> 10:06.981
I think I just fell apart.

10:14.572 --> 10:15.948
Am I crazy?

10:39.847 --> 10:41.015
What drink do you want?

10:42.516 --> 10:43.601
Whatever.

10:49.315 --> 10:50.983
I was in another serious accident

10:51.734 --> 10:53.944
when I was about seven…

10:55.988 --> 10:57.490
but I have no memory of it.

10:58.783 --> 11:00.868
My parents died in that accident,

11:01.952 --> 11:03.454
but I don't remember a thing.

11:04.038 --> 11:09.210
Is there any history of mental illness
in your family?

11:10.252 --> 11:12.213
I grew up in my uncle's home…

11:14.465 --> 11:17.802
and no one on my father's side
suffered from mental health issues.

11:18.427 --> 11:20.012
As for my mother's side…

11:24.475 --> 11:26.602
I was told the accident
was my mom's fault.

11:29.021 --> 11:31.607
So no one ever told me anything about her.

11:32.566 --> 11:34.068
I wouldn't know about her side.

11:48.582 --> 11:51.627
As you can see,
Mu-hee is in pretty bad shape.

11:52.753 --> 11:54.755
After graduating from high school,

11:54.839 --> 11:58.217
she wrote a note cutting ties
with her dad's side of the family.

11:58.300 --> 12:01.429
Whether she lives or dies,
please don't contact us.

12:02.513 --> 12:03.347
Pardon?

12:05.641 --> 12:07.435
How heartless.

12:19.280 --> 12:20.990
Sedatives are just a quick fix.

12:21.073 --> 12:23.826
As soon as you get back to Korea,
get checked out properly.

12:24.410 --> 12:25.828
I can take care of myself.

12:26.328 --> 12:27.288
That's not from me.

12:27.371 --> 12:29.915
I'm just relaying
what the doctor said earlier.

12:31.041 --> 12:35.129
According to him, your condition
may not be stress-related but…

12:37.173 --> 12:39.300
brain damage as a result of your accident.

12:40.509 --> 12:43.345
I understood everything,
thanks to you, so you can stop now.

12:48.267 --> 12:49.727
Your manager called me.

12:50.227 --> 12:52.438
I told him to come here.
He'll be arriving soon.

12:52.938 --> 12:54.231
You told Yong-u?

12:54.315 --> 12:57.610
He said he was looking for you,
and I told him you were with me.

12:59.403 --> 13:00.529
You told him we're here?

13:01.113 --> 13:02.656
I said we came to see a doctor

13:02.740 --> 13:06.744
because you had a sudden stomachache
and came to me for help.

13:07.328 --> 13:08.162
Right.

13:09.079 --> 13:10.539
So you said I had a stomachache.

13:16.295 --> 13:17.505
It's just funny.

13:18.214 --> 13:21.926
I never told him, but Yong-u figured out
that I had made my move and got rejected.

13:23.219 --> 13:24.512
He must think I'm pathetic,

13:25.012 --> 13:29.225
seeking out the guy who rejected me,
whining about a stomachache.

13:30.601 --> 13:32.436
He'll probably think I'm so thirsty.

13:36.649 --> 13:38.943
Maybe the meds are hitting.
I can't stop laughing.

13:51.831 --> 13:54.083
What's wrong with me?
I really must be mad.

14:11.809 --> 14:13.561
Thanks for your help today, Mr. Joo.

14:15.354 --> 14:17.189
But I don't think I can repay you.

14:18.566 --> 14:20.985
Because I never want to see you again.

14:24.029 --> 14:26.115
All you did was interpret my words…

14:28.200 --> 14:29.785
but you've heard too much about me.

14:33.956 --> 14:37.626
So I don't even know what face to make
when I look at you.

14:39.712 --> 14:41.505
Today, I just laughed…

14:45.509 --> 14:47.177
but I might cry when we meet again.

14:52.474 --> 14:56.645
You should go before Yong-u gets here.
Thank you so much, and sorry about today.

15:01.650 --> 15:03.152
The doctor said you should rest,

15:03.235 --> 15:05.487
but I'm guessing
you'll go to that big event.

15:05.571 --> 15:08.115
Of course.
I told you, this is my festival.

15:09.867 --> 15:13.245
I really love my life right now.

15:14.121 --> 15:15.956
I never, ever want to stop.

15:18.876 --> 15:21.003
Sure, enjoy the festival,

15:21.503 --> 15:23.923
but please don't drink
since you've taken a sedative.

15:24.506 --> 15:26.216
Did the doctor say that too?

15:26.300 --> 15:27.635
I wasn't interpreting.

15:28.218 --> 15:30.137
They're my own words of concern.

16:23.607 --> 16:26.568
-I'm a big fan. Can we take a picture?
-Okay.

16:51.260 --> 16:52.886
Maybe it's because of the meds.

16:56.056 --> 16:57.266
I'm so sleepy.

17:10.654 --> 17:11.697
It's the zombie.

17:14.950 --> 17:15.784
Hello.

17:18.954 --> 17:19.997
So we meet again.

17:21.957 --> 17:22.916
So you're Japanese.

17:25.252 --> 17:26.503
He's pretty handsome.

17:27.504 --> 17:28.338
Is he an actor?

17:30.215 --> 17:31.717
What's she saying?

17:41.101 --> 17:44.021
Why does he keep looking at me?

17:45.773 --> 17:47.149
Does he have something to say?

17:50.903 --> 17:52.321
What's with this woman?

17:52.404 --> 17:54.573
Aren't you going to thank me at all?

17:54.656 --> 17:56.533
A simple "thank you" isn't that hard.

18:14.510 --> 18:17.096
Okay, one, two, three, "V!"

18:18.305 --> 18:19.264
Now, hearts?

18:19.348 --> 18:22.434
-Here, one, two, three. Hearts!
-Hearts?

18:24.061 --> 18:25.395
Thank you very much.

18:32.361 --> 18:35.322
Does she think she did me a favor
by taking a selfie with me?

18:37.324 --> 18:39.451
That zombie doesn't realize who I am.

18:44.248 --> 18:45.791
He seems very familiar.

18:46.792 --> 18:48.919
Perhaps he was in a movie I've seen?

19:01.265 --> 19:02.724
Oh, thank you!

19:04.685 --> 19:05.978
Please take this!

19:10.649 --> 19:12.276
Please take this!

19:13.068 --> 19:15.195
I read the project proposal you sent,

19:15.696 --> 19:18.157
but I have minimal experience with TV.

19:18.657 --> 19:20.242
I'm not sure I'd be a good fit.

19:20.325 --> 19:21.869
Don't you worry.

19:23.078 --> 19:25.080
That doesn't matter at all.

19:25.164 --> 19:29.293
We'll be traveling to several countries
in Europe and North America for our show.

19:29.376 --> 19:31.837
When we heard someone actually existed

19:31.920 --> 19:34.631
who knew the languages
of every country we were visiting,

19:35.299 --> 19:37.551
we thought, "We've found our savior!"

19:37.634 --> 19:40.220
Please help us out, just this once.

19:40.721 --> 19:42.806
How long is the filming period?

19:45.058 --> 19:47.269
The overseas shoots will be a bit long.

19:47.352 --> 19:50.189
In total, about three to four months?

19:52.107 --> 19:54.234
Right, that's pretty long.

19:54.318 --> 19:56.486
We'll be hopping from country to country.

19:56.570 --> 19:59.489
But we'll come back to Korea a few times
in between filming. Right, Ms. Cho?

20:00.699 --> 20:01.742
Of course.

20:01.825 --> 20:03.535
And the show's called Romantic Trip,

20:03.619 --> 20:06.788
so we're only going
to magical, scenic places.

20:06.872 --> 20:09.625
-Wow, sounds wonderful.
-Jaw-dropping sites.

20:09.708 --> 20:11.627
Nothing rough or strenuous at all.

20:11.710 --> 20:13.503
-Right, Director Kim?
-Of course.

20:14.004 --> 20:16.715
Did you watch the last season in Korea
that aired last year?

20:16.798 --> 20:18.884
You'd get the gist if you had.

20:19.384 --> 20:23.138
I worked with Producer Shin Ji-sun,
who introduced you to us, on that season.

20:24.181 --> 20:27.100
Ms. Shin Ji-sun introduced me to you?

20:27.184 --> 20:28.060
-Yes.
-Yes.

20:28.644 --> 20:33.482
Speaking of, Ms. Shin said
she would drop by to see you, Mr. Joo.

20:37.194 --> 20:38.195
Oh, hey.

20:38.278 --> 20:39.321
Where's Ho-jin?

20:39.947 --> 20:41.782
He left for a prior engagement.

20:41.865 --> 20:42.950
He did?

20:43.492 --> 20:46.078
-I thought we'd have lunch together.
-Yeah.

20:46.161 --> 20:49.873
I was hoping to butter him up over lunch,
but he wouldn't take the bait.

20:49.957 --> 20:53.460
Ms. Shin, didn't you say
you're dating his older brother?

20:53.543 --> 20:56.672
Tell him to put in a good word for us.

20:57.172 --> 20:58.507
We're desperate.

20:59.675 --> 21:02.135
Well, my boyfriend
doesn't listen to me either.

21:02.219 --> 21:03.512
But I'll try talking to him.

21:22.823 --> 21:24.992
Look. Isn't that Na Jin-suk, the writer?

21:26.618 --> 21:28.829
He came for a book signing, remember?

21:28.912 --> 21:30.497
You're right. It is Na Jin-suk.

21:31.415 --> 21:33.542
Still a flashy dresser, I see.

21:36.336 --> 21:38.463
Hey. I was going to…

21:43.343 --> 21:45.137
So you won't do the job?

21:45.220 --> 21:49.349
I don't need to take a job in TV
when I already have plenty of projects.

21:50.517 --> 21:52.019
All right, then don't.

21:52.102 --> 21:55.480
From what I heard, you'd have to be
out of the country for a good while.

21:55.981 --> 21:57.357
Then you'd miss our wedding.

22:00.694 --> 22:01.528
Wedding?

22:03.322 --> 22:05.574
We're getting married next month.

22:06.158 --> 22:07.117
I've made up my mind.

22:07.200 --> 22:08.994
I'm going to tell Ji-sun too.

22:09.786 --> 22:13.665
So you went ahead and decided that alone?
And it's as soon as next month?

22:13.749 --> 22:17.878
She's wanted to get married all along.
I'm the one who's been holding out.

22:17.961 --> 22:20.297
It's been a constant argument between us.

22:20.380 --> 22:24.468
I'm so sick of arguing now,
and I've made up my mind.

22:25.052 --> 22:27.679
So marriage it is.
Not gonna congratulate me?

22:28.347 --> 22:32.476
Seems premature to congratulate you
when she doesn't even know it's happening.

22:32.559 --> 22:34.728
Come on, congratulate me.

22:35.312 --> 22:38.398
Please? You're the only sane,
sensible one in our family.

22:39.566 --> 22:43.487
You're the only family I'm not embarrassed
to introduce to Ji-sun.

22:43.570 --> 22:45.280
Please help your big bro out.

22:48.450 --> 22:50.660
I'm somewhat embarrassed by you. How…

22:53.038 --> 22:55.207
Where did you even get that tablecloth?

22:58.001 --> 22:59.086
Doesn't it look nice?

22:59.586 --> 23:02.714
No, it doesn't go
with the rest of your outfit at all.

23:03.840 --> 23:05.217
Wait, it doesn't?

23:05.300 --> 23:07.719
-You try it on, then.
-No, I'm good.

23:07.803 --> 23:10.847
And I want the robot vacuum
you took from my place back.

23:10.931 --> 23:14.976
No, not him! We've already bonded.
I've even given him a name, Alberto.

23:15.060 --> 23:16.561
What are you talking about?

23:16.645 --> 23:20.357
If I say "socks,"
he even fetches my socks, you know.

23:21.733 --> 23:25.570
-You okay? Do you need a cab?
-No, I'm good. She said she'd pick me up.

23:26.488 --> 23:27.864
Look. She's here already.

23:32.369 --> 23:33.203
Hey.

23:33.912 --> 23:34.913
You, hush!

23:37.207 --> 23:39.793
You're a real hassle, you know.
Ever heard of cabs?

23:40.377 --> 23:43.130
-Ho-jin, it's been a while.
-Thanks for coming.

23:43.213 --> 23:44.381
What's this?

23:47.384 --> 23:48.385
A flower.

23:49.553 --> 23:52.013
What, so you're the only one
who's drunk again?

23:52.514 --> 23:55.767
As usual, you're the only one
having fun, aren't you?

23:55.851 --> 23:58.103
No, I'm here today as per your command.

23:58.186 --> 23:59.813
You wanted me to pressure him.

24:00.313 --> 24:02.649
Really? Well, did it work?

24:03.358 --> 24:06.319
Jeong-su was really hoping
you'd sign on to his show.

24:06.403 --> 24:09.156
No, he says he doesn't want to.
He has no reason to.

24:09.239 --> 24:10.240
Hey, take this.

24:11.700 --> 24:12.534
-See you!
-Come on.

24:13.201 --> 24:14.327
Hey, take this back!

24:14.411 --> 24:16.663
Man, that looks great on you.
You're the best.

24:17.164 --> 24:19.708
-It doesn't look--
-Give it to me. It's mine.

24:20.208 --> 24:23.545
He gave it to me for my birthday,
but he likes it so much that he wears it.

24:24.045 --> 24:25.297
I'm sorry. I didn't know.

24:26.631 --> 24:27.966
Why would you be sorry?

24:28.633 --> 24:30.635
It's his fault for being inconsiderate.

24:31.178 --> 24:33.513
He probably doesn't even remember
giving it to me.

24:37.309 --> 24:41.188
If he's being inconsiderate,
get mad at him. Don't just laugh it off.

24:43.815 --> 24:44.900
Jin-suk assumes

24:45.817 --> 24:48.069
everything's fine
unless you tell him otherwise.

24:49.154 --> 24:51.448
He thinks everyone's happy
as long as he is.

24:53.700 --> 24:54.659
You're right.

24:55.160 --> 24:58.663
If I keep indulging him,
I'll eventually grow tired.

25:04.920 --> 25:06.338
Should I beat him?

25:07.881 --> 25:11.426
Can I whip your brother
a few times, like this?

25:12.761 --> 25:14.513
Yes, beat some sense into him.

25:16.306 --> 25:17.641
Na Jin-suk's dead meat today.

25:17.724 --> 25:19.726
Would whipping him with that even hurt?

25:21.853 --> 25:23.688
I shouldn't actually hurt him.

25:24.231 --> 25:26.191
Do you really think I want to hurt him?

25:26.691 --> 25:29.027
I just want to scare him
into treating me better.

25:30.946 --> 25:34.783
By the way, are you really not interested
in the show Jeong-su is producing?

25:35.659 --> 25:38.537
Shooting starts next month,
so he seemed pretty desperate.

25:39.246 --> 25:42.290
We're getting married next month.
I've made up my mind.

25:43.750 --> 25:46.711
Please reconsider.
Try to see it in a more positive light.

25:48.547 --> 25:49.839
All right, I will.

25:50.507 --> 25:51.341
Really?

25:52.384 --> 25:54.010
I think I now have a reason

25:55.011 --> 25:56.513
to accept the job.

26:10.193 --> 26:11.778
Hey, Mr. Joo!

26:13.905 --> 26:16.366
Good night!

26:16.449 --> 26:18.410
-See you. Be careful!
-My little brother!

26:18.493 --> 26:19.619
Good night!

26:35.802 --> 26:38.263
We're so happy to have you on board.
Thank you so much.

26:38.346 --> 26:39.681
I should be thanking you.

26:39.764 --> 26:45.687
We were so worried that you'd say no
because of the long international shoots.

26:46.479 --> 26:50.567
Going by the schedule you sent,
will we be in Canada next month?

26:50.650 --> 26:52.611
Yes. Why?

26:52.694 --> 26:56.364
Would you need to come back to Korea
partway through?

26:56.448 --> 26:59.367
No, I'd prefer to be overseas and busy.

26:59.951 --> 27:02.120
Thanks so much for signing on!

27:02.621 --> 27:03.622
Our savior!

27:06.374 --> 27:07.667
It looks like she's here.

27:07.751 --> 27:11.630
Our female cast member is here
to do a preliminary interview.

27:11.713 --> 27:14.924
Since you'll be interpreting for her,
why not come say hello?

27:15.008 --> 27:16.968
Has the cast member been finalized?

27:17.052 --> 27:19.137
There were several names
on the list you sent.

27:19.220 --> 27:20.472
It isn't any of them.

27:20.555 --> 27:23.016
We found someone new last minute.
She's an actress.

27:23.099 --> 27:25.560
Have you seen the movie The Quiet Woman?

27:26.353 --> 27:28.355
Most people don't know the movie's title.

27:28.438 --> 27:29.272
Is that right?

27:29.356 --> 27:30.398
Do Ra-mi.

27:30.482 --> 27:31.900
You know Do Ra-mi, don't you?

27:33.234 --> 27:34.444
Do Ra-mi, as in--

27:34.527 --> 27:36.112
Ms. Cha Mu-hee is here.

27:45.580 --> 27:47.040
-Hello.
-Hello.

27:47.123 --> 27:48.500
Welcome!

27:52.170 --> 27:56.383
This is Mr. Joo Ho-jin, the interpreter
who will be working on our show.

27:56.466 --> 27:58.426
Mr. Joo, you know Cha Mu-hee, right?

27:59.177 --> 28:00.053
Right, yes.

28:02.555 --> 28:03.682
Mr. Joo!

28:05.016 --> 28:06.309
Do you know each other?

28:06.393 --> 28:10.063
He was the interpreter for an interview
she did with a foreign magazine.

28:10.146 --> 28:12.857
Really? That's great.

28:12.941 --> 28:14.859
You'll be traveling together for a while,

28:14.943 --> 28:17.862
so if you already know each other,
this will be a breeze!

28:18.446 --> 28:19.364
Small world!

28:21.116 --> 28:25.078
I had no idea
I'd run into you again here, Mr. Joo.

28:26.329 --> 28:30.375
I didn't think I'd be working
with you again either, Ms. Cha Mu-hee.

28:36.965 --> 28:40.844
You made it seem like
you'd never work in TV, yet here you are.

28:42.345 --> 28:43.680
Are you doing better now?

28:44.222 --> 28:45.682
Did you see a doctor?

28:47.434 --> 28:50.520
Please don't bring that up here.

28:51.730 --> 28:54.357
Let's talk about this later
in private, Mr. Joo.

28:54.858 --> 28:57.318
Ms. Cha Mu-hee,
we're about to start the interview.

28:57.402 --> 28:58.319
Okay.

29:02.365 --> 29:06.244
Ms. Cho, the writer, will ask you
about five or six questions.

29:06.327 --> 29:07.162
Got it.

29:07.245 --> 29:08.788
Okay, let's get ready.

29:16.588 --> 29:17.464
Mu-hee.

29:17.964 --> 29:22.427
Just speak naturally and comfortably,
like you're talking to a friend.

29:22.510 --> 29:25.722
Look into the camera.
I'll be asking you the questions.

29:26.222 --> 29:27.223
All right.

29:33.229 --> 29:34.481
Let's get started.

29:36.316 --> 29:39.527
Ms. Cha Mu-hee, do you like to travel?

29:40.612 --> 29:42.489
Yes, I do.

29:43.072 --> 29:45.950
But I haven't had
many opportunities to travel.

29:47.243 --> 29:50.038
Still, I like visiting new places.

29:56.294 --> 29:57.170
Shush!

30:01.341 --> 30:03.927
Sorry, Mu-hee.
Let's start again from the top.

30:06.095 --> 30:07.722
Do you like to travel?

30:10.391 --> 30:12.185
Travel?

30:14.270 --> 30:16.898
Travel… travel, yes.

30:17.690 --> 30:20.151
But I haven't had many chances to travel.

30:45.134 --> 30:46.135
Mu-hee.

30:48.179 --> 30:49.180
Mu-hee!

30:53.977 --> 30:55.103
I'm sorry.

30:55.186 --> 30:57.605
Please keep your eyes on the camera.

30:57.689 --> 31:00.316
And relax your hands a bit.

31:01.693 --> 31:03.820
I'm sorry. My apologies.

31:05.989 --> 31:07.115
Sorry, I'll start again.

31:17.959 --> 31:18.793
I'm sorry.

31:19.419 --> 31:21.504
Sorry, let me do that again.

31:22.338 --> 31:25.008
I haven't had many chances to travel, but…

31:25.967 --> 31:26.926
But…

31:36.060 --> 31:37.478
Let me do that again.

31:45.904 --> 31:47.113
My apologies.

31:49.991 --> 31:51.659
Let's take a break.

31:52.368 --> 31:53.536
She's awful.

31:54.287 --> 31:57.206
She's not well-spoken, not funny,
and can't even focus.

31:57.290 --> 32:01.711
Maybe it was just Do Ra-mi, the character.
The actress herself has no charm.

32:02.837 --> 32:06.674
She did okay
when she appeared on Junprecedented.

32:08.259 --> 32:10.428
Well, there you have
Jun Hyun-moo as the host.

32:12.180 --> 32:13.389
Let's end the shoot.

32:14.140 --> 32:17.352
Let's rethink the female cast member.
I'm not so sure about Cha Mu-hee.

32:17.852 --> 32:20.355
I thought you said we'd make it big.
Like Blackpink big!

32:20.438 --> 32:22.023
I don't think we will!

32:23.566 --> 32:25.068
How do I send her packing?

32:25.151 --> 32:28.071
She probably came in
believing this was a done deal.

32:43.711 --> 32:45.380
I screwed up the shoot, didn't I?

32:45.880 --> 32:47.423
Ms. Cho did not look happy.

32:47.507 --> 32:50.093
You were just nervous
about doing something new.

32:50.885 --> 32:52.845
It'll get easier once you get used to it.

32:57.100 --> 32:58.476
By the way, Mu-hee,

33:00.269 --> 33:02.814
did you really not know
Mr. Joo was working on this show?

33:03.523 --> 33:05.525
Didn't you see how shocked I was?

33:05.608 --> 33:07.485
I'm not that good an actress.

33:09.195 --> 33:11.155
What's he even doing here anyway?

33:13.074 --> 33:15.368
I actually asked
the assistant director in passing.

33:15.868 --> 33:17.996
He only signed on
as a favor to Producer Shin.

33:18.496 --> 33:19.455
Producer Shin Ji-sun?

33:20.081 --> 33:22.583
The woman we found
by digging through his Instagram.

33:22.667 --> 33:23.668
Yeah, I know.

33:26.587 --> 33:28.506
So he's here because of her.

33:28.589 --> 33:31.592
She was the coproducer
of the Korean season of Romantic Trip.

33:31.676 --> 33:36.389
I hear he adamantly refused at first,
but she talked him into it.

33:37.890 --> 33:39.726
It seems he still likes her a lot.

33:40.226 --> 33:42.645
Okay, I got it. Stop it.

33:43.271 --> 33:44.522
What's wrong with you?

33:51.362 --> 33:54.615
Let's finish
the rest of our conversation here.

33:54.699 --> 33:56.034
Did you see a doctor?

33:56.117 --> 33:57.618
I can take care of myself.

33:58.578 --> 34:01.414
You made it seem like
you weren't into TV gigs.

34:01.956 --> 34:03.166
I guess that wasn't true.

34:03.249 --> 34:05.209
Did your doctor say you can take this on?

34:06.419 --> 34:09.464
You'd be out of the country for a while.
That won't be a problem?

34:09.547 --> 34:12.675
That's not a problem…
as long as I'm okay with it.

34:13.509 --> 34:16.179
What about you?
Will you be okay working with me?

34:16.262 --> 34:17.638
Don't try to change the topic.

34:18.139 --> 34:20.099
Have you seen a doctor?

34:21.434 --> 34:23.102
Seeing me again bothers you, right?

34:23.686 --> 34:24.771
I feel the same.

34:24.854 --> 34:27.398
Can't you just drop out of this project?

34:30.109 --> 34:31.819
I don't enjoy feeling uncomfortable.

34:33.446 --> 34:35.239
You pulled me in as an interpreter,

34:35.865 --> 34:37.658
and I heard things I wish I hadn't.

34:38.618 --> 34:40.703
It bothers me, so just give me an answer.

34:40.787 --> 34:42.121
Then I'll drop out.

34:47.168 --> 34:48.169
I…

34:50.755 --> 34:51.756
did see a doctor.

35:00.098 --> 35:02.975
Did the accident

35:03.059 --> 35:05.103
somehow damage my brain?

35:06.646 --> 35:08.231
According to the MRI,

35:08.773 --> 35:11.526
there's nothing wrong with your brain,
Ms. Cha Mu-hee.

35:12.860 --> 35:16.030
However, if you are indeed suffering
from hallucinations,

35:16.656 --> 35:20.952
something must be damaged
that modern medicine can't diagnose.

35:23.621 --> 35:25.832
Then what's going to happen to me?

35:27.083 --> 35:31.754
You're not suffering from any paralysis
or memory issues, just hallucinations.

35:33.214 --> 35:35.925
You should see a psychiatrist regularly.

35:36.509 --> 35:38.761
I did, but they told me
to see a neurologist

35:38.845 --> 35:40.930
since it's likely accident-related.

35:41.931 --> 35:45.226
I swear, I'm completely fine
except for occasionally seeing Do Ra-mi.

35:45.726 --> 35:47.770
Can't I just chase her away?

35:49.147 --> 35:54.068
As we don't know why she's showing up
or why it's Do Ra-mi in particular,

35:54.902 --> 35:56.571
we have no way to chase her away.

35:58.614 --> 36:01.284
There's no way to chase Do Ra-mi away
with modern medicine.

36:01.367 --> 36:04.662
I was so frustrated
that I even visited a shaman.

36:04.745 --> 36:07.665
But since she's not a ghost,
no ritual would work.

36:09.500 --> 36:10.334
Satisfied?

36:10.918 --> 36:12.587
Does that lessen your discomfort?

36:14.172 --> 36:16.841
Now drop out like you promised.
End of conversation.

36:18.009 --> 36:20.636
Me dropping out won't solve your problem.

36:23.472 --> 36:25.266
You were visibly shaken earlier.

36:26.642 --> 36:29.270
You seemed like
a completely different person today

36:29.896 --> 36:31.105
from the last time on set.

36:31.189 --> 36:33.733
Well, I am. Do Ra-mi's in my head now.

36:33.816 --> 36:35.151
Can you keep going like this?

36:36.277 --> 36:38.738
So what? Will you tell the producer
so they drop me?

36:39.655 --> 36:42.241
Go ahead. Tell them,
"She sees Do Ra-mi. She's crazy."

36:42.325 --> 36:43.743
Then I'd be dropped instantly.

36:43.826 --> 36:45.369
I don't have to do anything.

36:46.537 --> 36:48.122
That will happen regardless.

36:49.624 --> 36:50.833
The director's note says,

36:50.917 --> 36:53.294
"The joy of travel,
the thrill of romance."

36:54.253 --> 36:58.216
Who would feel happy or thrilled
looking at your anxious, restless eyes?

36:59.425 --> 37:01.510
Just looking at you makes me feel uneasy.

37:03.846 --> 37:05.973
You've admitted to yourself
that you're crazy,

37:06.474 --> 37:08.768
yet you seem to have no desire
to grasp reality.

37:10.394 --> 37:12.104
I guess I won't bother stopping you.

37:14.774 --> 37:16.317
Good luck, Ms. Cha Mu-hee.

37:17.318 --> 37:18.611
I'll drop out, as you wish.

37:21.530 --> 37:23.282
Thank you, Mr. Joo Ho-jin.

37:25.451 --> 37:26.535
But will you be okay?

37:27.536 --> 37:30.081
If you drop out now,
you'll disappoint the woman you like.

37:31.791 --> 37:34.543
Didn't you only take this job
to impress Producer Shin Ji-sun?

37:35.795 --> 37:39.632
You said you'd keep it a secret forever,
but I guess you changed your mind.

37:46.472 --> 37:49.475
You must've already told her
and gotten a ton of credit for it.

37:50.226 --> 37:52.436
Dropping out now
would put you in a tough spot.

37:53.729 --> 37:56.440
Yes, it does put me in a tough spot.

37:57.108 --> 37:58.693
Now I have no means of avoiding it.

38:00.611 --> 38:02.196
She's getting married soon.

38:02.863 --> 38:03.823
To my brother.

38:08.577 --> 38:11.497
I wanted to avoid having to help out
and be stuck watching.

38:12.331 --> 38:14.041
So I found a way to do that…

38:16.043 --> 38:19.005
but I lost it
trying to avoid a crazy person.

38:30.182 --> 38:31.017
You idiot.

38:41.235 --> 38:42.069
Mr. Joo!

38:43.779 --> 38:46.115
Hey, are you and Ms. Cho close?

38:48.242 --> 38:50.328
I think they're dropping Mu-hee
from the show.

38:50.828 --> 38:52.330
They must've hated the interview.

38:52.413 --> 38:55.041
They stopped the shoot
and aren't giving me the contract.

38:55.541 --> 38:56.792
I have a bad feeling.

38:57.585 --> 38:59.045
Could you put in a good word?

38:59.628 --> 39:01.172
I'm telling them I'm dropping out.

39:01.756 --> 39:02.757
That's it.

39:02.840 --> 39:05.551
Tell them if they drop Mu-hee,
you'll walk.

39:05.634 --> 39:07.511
They seem to really like you.

39:08.012 --> 39:09.764
That's not why I'm dropping out.

39:11.474 --> 39:12.933
Don't get me involved.

39:14.727 --> 39:15.770
Mr. Joo!

39:18.522 --> 39:21.650
Please join us for a meal today.
We can discuss the show as we eat.

39:21.734 --> 39:23.944
-I have something to say.
-Let's talk over lunch.

39:24.028 --> 39:26.697
We booked the Japanese place out front.
Do you drink?

39:26.781 --> 39:28.324
We have the company card.

39:29.075 --> 39:30.785
Let's all go. Let's go.

39:31.994 --> 39:33.954
If Mu-hee's out, so are you. Loyalty!

39:34.038 --> 39:36.582
-I said keep me out of it.
-Come on.

39:59.897 --> 40:02.316
Get in. We should go together.

40:03.651 --> 40:04.693
Now you're talking to me?

40:11.534 --> 40:12.618
Fine.

40:13.119 --> 40:14.286
I'll go with you.

40:27.258 --> 40:28.759
So you're finally acknowledging me.

40:30.970 --> 40:32.096
But it's a shame.

40:33.013 --> 40:35.558
You made a fool of yourself
in front of the guy you like.

40:38.894 --> 40:40.729
-You crazy bitch.
-Just shut up!

40:40.813 --> 40:43.274
I said shut up! Be quiet!

40:43.774 --> 40:44.775
Go away!

40:45.985 --> 40:47.111
Get away from me!

41:28.527 --> 41:30.321
Fucking hell.

41:39.997 --> 41:41.165
I scared you, didn't I?

41:41.248 --> 41:42.583
The truth is,

41:43.083 --> 41:45.961
something almost drove me mad,
so I let it.

41:48.172 --> 41:49.048
Ms. Cho.

41:49.924 --> 41:51.717
You seem quite surprised.

41:51.800 --> 41:53.093
Sorry about that.

41:55.429 --> 41:56.889
You don't like me, do you?

41:57.848 --> 42:01.018
Earlier, you were looking at me
from behind the camera with a totally…

42:03.229 --> 42:04.230
Director Kim!

42:05.022 --> 42:06.565
You were debating, weren't you?

42:06.649 --> 42:07.983
"How do we drop her?"

42:08.776 --> 42:11.362
Just straight up go for it.

42:11.862 --> 42:14.448
Sure, I'll be bitter,
but it's not like I'd take revenge.

42:14.532 --> 42:16.951
It's not like I really am Do Ra-mi.

42:22.414 --> 42:23.249
Mu-hee.

42:43.269 --> 42:44.270
Yong-u.

42:45.187 --> 42:46.021
Let's go.

43:14.300 --> 43:15.301
Ho-jin.

43:15.384 --> 43:17.303
Can you help me for a minute?

43:17.386 --> 43:19.179
-Sure.
-I need an extra hand.

43:20.306 --> 43:23.726
Can you grab the book
on the top shelf over there?

43:24.226 --> 43:26.854
On the right. The one
that's the color of a leaf in fall.

43:27.479 --> 43:28.689
That's the one.

43:36.196 --> 43:37.281
What's this?

43:40.034 --> 43:41.785
It's your family photo.

43:42.828 --> 43:46.040
The dad, mom, and son may all be living
in different countries now,

43:46.540 --> 43:48.000
but you seem close here.

43:48.083 --> 43:50.169
Well, I was only in elementary school.

43:51.086 --> 43:53.464
-And the tall one here is Na Jin-suk?
-Yes.

43:53.547 --> 43:56.216
What's he doing in your family photo?

43:56.717 --> 43:57.926
He's still Father's son.

44:00.971 --> 44:01.889
My goodness.

44:01.972 --> 44:05.476
I don't get your mom,
accepting her husband's illegitimate son,

44:05.559 --> 44:08.145
or your dad, grinning happily beside her.

44:08.646 --> 44:10.481
Or Na Jin-suk's eagerness to be included.

44:11.065 --> 44:13.192
Your family sure is a strange bunch.

44:13.275 --> 44:14.902
Want to know something even stranger?

44:16.236 --> 44:17.279
This photo

44:17.821 --> 44:19.615
was taken by Jin-suk's mother.

44:19.698 --> 44:20.658
What?

44:23.535 --> 44:25.120
Oh, for crying out loud.

44:25.621 --> 44:28.415
Your family's so open-minded.
It's like you're American!

44:28.499 --> 44:30.042
Unbelievable.

44:30.542 --> 44:33.379
Will the family be getting together again
for Jin-suk's wedding?

44:35.130 --> 44:38.092
He called me and asked me to officiate.

44:38.175 --> 44:39.510
He said it's next month.

44:40.260 --> 44:41.762
I played coy and said no.

44:43.013 --> 44:44.181
You shouldn't have.

44:44.264 --> 44:45.599
I don't want to.

44:46.642 --> 44:50.312
I've already decided the first wedding
I'll officiate will be yours, Joo Ho-jin.

44:53.023 --> 44:56.652
So… how are things going
with that actress?

44:57.653 --> 44:59.822
I'm telling you, nothing is going on.

45:00.823 --> 45:03.117
You can't pull the wool
over this old man's eyes.

45:03.200 --> 45:05.911
Make an effort, and don't play coy.

45:05.994 --> 45:07.871
And speak to her a little more kindly.

45:10.249 --> 45:12.793
Do I tend to speak unkindly?

45:13.711 --> 45:18.382
You're downright mean and blunt
when you're saying the right thing.

45:21.969 --> 45:26.265
Do you know how many languages
there are in the world, Mr. Interpreter?

45:28.183 --> 45:30.352
I believe over 7,100.

45:30.936 --> 45:32.855
Nope. Wrong answer.

45:34.189 --> 45:36.692
There are as many languages
as there are people.

45:36.775 --> 45:39.486
Everyone speaks their own language.

45:40.028 --> 45:44.408
That's why people misunderstand,
misinterpret, and offend each other.

45:47.202 --> 45:49.538
From what I've heard,
Joo Ho-jin's language

45:50.789 --> 45:53.250
is firm and neat,

45:54.668 --> 45:55.544
but sharp.

45:58.130 --> 46:01.800
Who would feel happy or thrilled
looking at your anxious, restless eyes?

46:02.760 --> 46:04.845
Just looking at you makes me feel uneasy.

46:07.681 --> 46:09.308
If my words were sharp…

46:12.102 --> 46:13.729
it must've hurt to hear them.

46:17.608 --> 46:18.567
You're needed.

46:19.067 --> 46:21.487
A diner at the restaurant
asked to see you.

46:21.570 --> 46:22.863
Can you come now?

46:33.457 --> 46:34.458
Please sit.

46:35.083 --> 46:38.587
Going to your place felt too stalker-ish,
so I asked you to meet me here.

46:48.931 --> 46:51.350
You saw me
wigging out that day, didn't you?

46:55.062 --> 46:57.481
The production staff
hasn't been in touch since.

46:58.482 --> 47:00.567
I think I lost that gig.

47:03.487 --> 47:05.656
I spoke out of line that day.

47:07.449 --> 47:10.536
No. I'm the one
who went mad and crossed the line.

47:14.248 --> 47:15.249
I'm sorry.

47:15.833 --> 47:18.585
I shouldn't have brought up
Producer Shin Ji-sun.

47:19.962 --> 47:23.090
I guess I wanted to
point out your weakness

47:24.174 --> 47:26.552
since you knew mine.

47:29.888 --> 47:32.307
So how is it now? Your weakness?

47:32.975 --> 47:33.809
Do Ra-mi?

47:36.311 --> 47:39.189
Since I flipped out like that,
she's been quiet.

47:39.273 --> 47:40.399
I don't see her.

47:43.026 --> 47:46.613
I guess letting it out once in a while
is more effective than a sedative.

47:49.700 --> 47:52.244
Still, try not to explode like that
just anywhere.

47:53.245 --> 47:54.454
I should be more careful.

47:57.958 --> 48:00.002
What about your weakness?

48:01.795 --> 48:03.672
They set a date for the wedding.

48:03.755 --> 48:07.551
I'm considering where to run away to
before I get roped into the wedding stuff.

48:14.725 --> 48:18.020
You should just work on that show
instead of looking for another gig.

48:19.229 --> 48:23.525
Yong-u says they're still
frantically searching for an interpreter.

48:23.609 --> 48:27.362
I know. They keep contacting me,
asking if I can join them.

48:28.113 --> 48:28.989
Really?

48:29.781 --> 48:30.782
Lucky you.

48:31.283 --> 48:32.284
I got canned.

48:32.784 --> 48:35.287
You sealed it with that meltdown,
and now you're bummed?

48:35.787 --> 48:36.872
Of course I am.

48:37.414 --> 48:39.082
It was a really good opportunity.

48:39.583 --> 48:41.126
For an image makeover.

48:42.753 --> 48:45.839
After Do Ra-mi's success,
a lot of scripts came my way,

48:45.923 --> 48:49.384
but they were all about serial killers
with split personalities or butchers.

48:50.510 --> 48:53.472
If I played all those roles,
I'd have a four-figure kill count.

48:53.972 --> 48:55.182
So as lethal as a missile.

48:56.516 --> 48:59.019
I really wanted to shed that image,

48:59.645 --> 49:01.438
and the objective of that show

49:01.521 --> 49:04.107
was "The joy of travel,
the thrill of romance."

49:06.026 --> 49:08.820
And seeing the Northern Lights
was on the itinerary.

49:09.321 --> 49:12.032
I've always wanted to go see them.

49:12.115 --> 49:15.869
Yeah, I've wanted to go there too.
It's a tough place to go alone.

49:15.953 --> 49:17.412
-Right?
-Yeah.

49:18.246 --> 49:20.040
Kinda tough to make it out there.

49:22.793 --> 49:24.962
It's just too bad.

49:38.266 --> 49:39.559
-Excuse me.
-Sure.

49:41.311 --> 49:42.396
Yes, Yong-u?

49:43.605 --> 49:44.856
The Northern Lights…

49:49.444 --> 49:50.278
What?

49:54.282 --> 49:55.659
Yeah, okay.

49:58.996 --> 50:00.580
Okay, I'll call you right back.

50:02.416 --> 50:03.291
All right.

50:16.138 --> 50:17.347
Is it Yong-u?

50:18.223 --> 50:19.516
If something's come up, go.

50:20.642 --> 50:24.021
I just booked something huge.

50:26.231 --> 50:28.275
The production team of Romantic Trip

50:28.358 --> 50:29.901
confirmed my casting.

50:30.444 --> 50:31.528
They sent a contract.

50:33.572 --> 50:34.489
That's…

50:36.366 --> 50:38.994
That's great.
You were disappointed earlier.

50:41.246 --> 50:42.080
But

50:43.373 --> 50:46.585
the thought of actually going
scares me a little.

50:47.544 --> 50:51.173
I hope you have
a happy, thrilling, festival-like trip.

50:52.758 --> 50:54.092
How will that be possible?

50:54.760 --> 50:55.635
Look here.

50:56.136 --> 50:59.473
How can you be so flippant about this
when you know about Do Ra-mi?

51:00.390 --> 51:04.019
Somewhere I don't speak the language
and no one knows what I'm going through.

51:04.102 --> 51:06.063
Do you think I'd be okay on my own?

51:07.230 --> 51:08.106
Look here.

51:08.648 --> 51:10.984
I'm gracefully removing myself
from the situation

51:11.068 --> 51:12.736
after giving you some encouragement.

51:13.278 --> 51:15.822
You wanted this.
Why provoke me to say words that cut?

51:15.906 --> 51:17.699
Whether it cuts or stings, go ahead.

51:17.783 --> 51:20.077
This time,
I'll understand it as your concern.

51:27.209 --> 51:28.627
Ms. Cha Mu-hee.

51:29.711 --> 51:32.589
You're a very spontaneous
and capricious person.

51:33.215 --> 51:37.094
You say "A," argue that you said "B,"
then go back on your word and say "C."

51:38.178 --> 51:40.972
Add Do Ra-mi,
the source of your anxiety, to the mix,

51:42.474 --> 51:44.309
and you'll explode again like last time.

51:44.810 --> 51:45.644
No doubt about it.

51:52.442 --> 51:53.568
You're right.

51:55.487 --> 51:56.488
Then…

51:58.865 --> 52:00.700
what if someone who knows everything

52:01.993 --> 52:05.205
and who can keep a cool head
and calm me down

52:05.914 --> 52:06.832
were there with me?

52:08.959 --> 52:13.463
And if they're good with languages,
I should feel at ease overseas, right?

52:14.464 --> 52:15.841
I think I could handle it

52:15.924 --> 52:17.759
if someone like that were with me.

52:18.260 --> 52:19.177
What do you think?

52:19.261 --> 52:20.262
Ms. Cha Mu-hee.

52:21.263 --> 52:22.973
Explain so I can understand.

52:23.682 --> 52:24.516
Your language,

52:24.599 --> 52:27.477
speaking in opposites to hide weakness
and lashing out when angry,

52:28.645 --> 52:30.272
is too hard for me to interpret.

52:30.355 --> 52:31.189
So you're saying--

52:31.273 --> 52:32.524
Please help me!

52:33.441 --> 52:36.069
I'd like you to come with me.

52:41.366 --> 52:42.784
Do I make you uncomfortable?

52:42.868 --> 52:45.203
Are you scared
I'll threaten you into dating me?

52:45.287 --> 52:46.830
Threats wouldn't work on me.

52:46.913 --> 52:48.415
Then let's go together.

52:49.541 --> 52:51.835
If you go,
you'll get to see the Northern Lights.

52:53.503 --> 52:54.838
The Northern Lights.

52:57.174 --> 52:59.843
The Northern Lights. Green and blue.

53:00.510 --> 53:01.845
You could take photos.

53:02.429 --> 53:04.848
Once-in-a-lifetime photos…
The Northern Lights!

53:14.107 --> 53:15.942
Fine. I'll join you.

53:17.194 --> 53:19.154
I need somewhere to hide anyway,

53:20.030 --> 53:22.908
and I also want to see
the Northern Lights.

53:22.991 --> 53:25.785
Great, let's go see
the Northern Lights together.

53:51.728 --> 53:54.689
CAN THIS LOVE BE TRANSLATED?

56:15.038 --> 56:20.043
Subtitle translation by: Jimin Choi
